PROJECT NOTICE

Crop_Detection is a computer vision project for crop detection, tracking,
localization, and depth estimation.

The project incorporates and/or is designed to work with third-party
software and frameworks, including but not limited to:

- YOLO / Ultralytics
- MiDaS
- ByteTrack
- Norfair
- Gradio
- PyTorch
- OpenCV
- NumPy
- Torchvision
- timm

These third-party components remain subject to their respective licenses,
copyrights, and terms. This MIT License applies to the original source code,
documentation, modifications, integration logic, and improvements developed
for the Crop_Detection project, to the extent that the project author has
the legal right to license them.

The project may include modifications, integrations, improvements, and
application-specific implementations involving object detection, object
tracking, depth estimation, coordinate estimation, and Gradio-based
interfaces.

Third-party model weights, datasets, pretrained models, and external source
code are not automatically relicensed under this MIT License. Users are
responsible for complying with the applicable licenses and terms of those
components.

The Crop_Detection project is provided for research, educational, and
development purposes. No guarantee is made regarding the accuracy,
reliability, suitability, or safety of the detection, tracking, or depth
estimation results.
